   SCM / Debug / Extensions / Testing / plugin views) as closable tiles right under the activity
   strip, doubling vertical chrome. */
#theia-app-shell.theia-mod-mobile-one-column #theia-left-content-panel .lm-DockPanel-tabBar,
#theia-app-shell.theia-mod-mobile-one-column #theia-right-content-panel .lm-DockPanel-tabBar {
